                "kind": "contains_food",
                "value": "牛肉"
              },
              {
                "path": "/days/2026-11-11/meals/dinner/items",
                "kind": "excludes_food",
                "value": "鸡胸肉"
              },
              {
                "path": "/days/2026-11-11/meals/lunch/items",
                "kind": "contains_food",
                "value": "鸡胸肉"
              }
            ],
            "allowed_changes": [
              "/days/2026-11-11/meals/dinner"
            ],
            "reference_to_previous": false,
            "completion": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "等等，不是牛肉了，那餐蛋白换成豆腐，饭照旧。",
          "expect": {
            "assertions": [
              {
                "path": "/days/2026-11-11/meals/dinner/items",
                "kind": "contains_food",
                "value": "豆腐"
              },
              {
                "path": "/days/2026-11-11/meals/dinner/items",
                "kind": "excludes_food",
                "value": "牛肉"
              },
              {
                "path": "/days/2026-11-11/meals/dinner/items",
                "kind": "contains_food",
                "value": "米饭"
              }
            ],
            "allowed_changes": [
              "/days/2026-11-11/meals/dinner"
            ],
            "reference_to_previous": true,
            "completion": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "今天早先改的那顿，重新用鸡胸肉，别把中饭也改了。",
          "expect": {
            "assertions": [
              {
                "path": "/days/2026-11-11/meals/dinner/items",
                "kind": "contains_food",
                "value": "鸡胸肉"
              },
              {
                "path": "/days/2026-11-11/meals/lunch/items",
                "kind": "contains_food",
                "value": "鸡胸肉"
              }
            ],
            "allowed_changes": [
              "/days/2026-11-11/meals/dinner"
            ],
            "reference_to_previous": true,
            "completion": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "holdout-scope-switch",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "划船今天留两组就好，深蹲保持四组。",
          "expect": {
            "assertions": [
              {
                "path": "/days/2026-11-11/actions/one-arm-dumbbell-row/sets",
                "value": 2
              },
              {
                "path": "/days/2026-11-11/actions/goblet-squat/sets",
                "value": 4
              }
            ],
            "allowed_changes": [
              "/days/2026-11-11/actions/one-arm-dumbbell-row/sets"
            ],
            "reference_to_previous": false,
            "completion": true
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "现在说晚饭，把里面的鸡胸肉改成豆腐，不是说训练。",
          "expect": {
            "assertions": [
              {
                "path": "/days/2026-11-11/meals/dinner/items",
                "kind": "contains_food",
                "value": "豆腐"
